{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的音乐感受描写明显不如X细腻，尤其缺少具体音型、力度、节奏变化与情绪转折之间的对应，也少了随音乐节点出现的提示。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分区让人可以先抓住人物正在经历什么，再用右侧短词感受音乐，叙事因果和前后转变也更容易连起来。X的重点加亮很有效，人物心理的关键矛盾更醒目，音乐感受也明显更具体、更有层次，但大量感受文字容易争夺注意力，部分段落需要观众在听音乐时处理过多信息。综合普通观众的实际观看体验，我选Y，但它牺牲了一部分X所具有的音乐表现细腻度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5d984b92-ae4e-4b57-bf56-e8686c7d996c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T213608071535Z", "elapsed_seconds": 81.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:37:29.706106+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b127064063564f800c45fdac82276db4155d5b41e78c480d40c6592f2c32cbcd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachment